<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who belongs to the class of data users as specified in the order made under subsection 14(1) shall submit an application for registration to the Commissioner in the manner and form as determined by the Commissioner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
