<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Every application for registration shall be accompanied with the prescribed registration fee and such documents as may be required by the Commissioner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
