<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_15__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commissioner may in writing at any time after receiving the application and before it is determined, require the applicant to provide such additional documents or information within the time as specified by the Commissioner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
