<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_16__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who belongs to the class of data users as specified in the order made under subsection 14(1) and who processes personal data without a certificate of registration issued in pursuance of paragraph 16(1)(a) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both. Renewal of certificate of registration"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
