<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A data user may make an application for the renewal of the certificate of registration not later than ninety days before the date of expiry of the certificate of registration in the manner and form as determined by the Commissioner and the application shall be accompanied with the prescribed renewal fee and such documents as may be required by the Commissioner, but no application for renewal shall be allowed where the application is made after the date of expiry of the certificate of registration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
