<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (1), the Commissioner shall not revoke the registration of a data user unless the Commissioner is satisfied that, after giving the data user an opportunity of making any representation in writing he may wish to make, the registration should be revoked."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
