<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_18__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the registration of the data user is revoked, the Commissioner shall issue a notice of revocation of registration to the data user, and the certificate of registration issued in respect of such registration shall have no effect upon service of the notice of revocation of registration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
