<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_42__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the data subject is dissatisfied with the failure of the data user to comply with the data subject notice, whether in whole or in part, under paragraph (3)(b), the data subject may submit an application to the Commissioner to require the data user to comply with the data subject notice."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_42__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_42> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
