<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_42__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Commissioner is satisfied that the application of the data subject under subsection (4) is justified or justified to any extent, the Commissioner may require the data user to take such steps for complying with the data subject notice."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_42__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_42> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
