<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_42__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "A data user who fails to comply with the requirement of the Commissioner under subsection (5) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding two hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both. Right to prevent processing for purposes of direct marketing"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
