<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_II__cl_43__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A data subject may, at any time by notice in writing to a data user, require the data user at the end of such period as is reasonable in the circumstances to cease or not to begin processing his personal data for purposes of direct marketing."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
