<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Without prejudice to the generality of subsection (1), the Commissioner shall, as soon as practicable after the end of each financial year, cause to be made and transmitted to the Minister and if so directed by the Minister to any other public authority, a report dealing with the activities of the Commissioner during the preceding financial year, and the report shall be in such form and shall contain such information relating to the proceedings and policies of the Commissioner as the Minister may specify."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
