<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_111__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commissioner shall issue to each authorized officer an authority card which shall be signed by the Commissioner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_111__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_111> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
