<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_113__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_113> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
