<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_120> <https://schema.org/name> "Any person who—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
