<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_120__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "refuses any authorized officer access to any premise which the authorized officer is entitled to have under this Act or in the execution of any duty imposed or power conferred by this Act;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_120__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_120> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
