<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_120__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "refuses any authorized officer any information relating to an offence or suspected offence under this Act or any other information which may reasonably be required of him and which he has in his knowledge or power to give, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to both. Power to require production of computer, book, account, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
