<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_121__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "to require the production of any identification document from any person in relation to any act or offence under this Act;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
