<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_121__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "to make such enquiries as may be necessary to ascertain whether the provisions of this Act have been complied with. Power to require attendance of persons acquainted with case"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
