<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_124__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "When any person is charged with any offence in relation to—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_124__subsec_5__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_124__subsec_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
