<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_127__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_IX__cl_127> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
