<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_106__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Commissioner refuses under this section to carry out or continue an investigation initiated by a complaint, he shall, as soon as practicable but in any case not later than thirty days after the date of receipt of the complaint, by notice in writing served on the complainant inform the complainant of the refusal and of the reasons for the refusal."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
