<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_107> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Commissioner is of the opinion that it is in the public interest so to do, he may carry out or continue an investigation initiated by a complaint notwithstanding that the complainant has withdrawn the complaint and, in any such case, the provisions of this Act shall apply to the complaint and the complainant as if the complaint had not been withdrawn. Enforcement notice"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
