<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_VII__cl_93__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The notice of appeal shall be made in writing to the Appeal Tribunal within thirty days from the date of the decision of the Commissioner, or in the case of an enforcement notice, within thirty days after the enforcement notice is served upon the relevant data user, and the appellant shall serve a copy of the notice of appeal upon the Commissioner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
