<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_VII__cl_93__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The notice of appeal shall state briefly the substance of the decision of the Commissioner against which an appeal is filed with the Appeal Tribunal, contain an address at which any notice or document connected with the appeal may be served upon the appellant or his advocate, and shall be signed by the appellant or his advocate. Record of decision of Commissioner"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
