<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_VII__cl_94__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The aggrieved person referred to in subsection 93(1) may, on his own initiative, request in writing from the Commissioner a statement of the grounds for his decision."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
