<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_VII__cl_94__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (3), the Commissioner shall, upon receiving the written request under subsection (1), provide to the aggrieved person, upon the payment of a prescribed fee, a copy of a statement of the grounds for his decision."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
