<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_XI__cl_146__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (2), any person who at the date of coming into operation of this Act either alone or jointly or in common with other persons processes any personal data or has control over or authorizes the processing of any personal data, shall within three months from the date of coming into operation of this Act be registered as a data user in accordance with the provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
