<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@/~part_X__cl_141__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both. Things done in anticipation of the enactment of this Act"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/35/eng@> .
